#: apps/marketing/views.py:12 frontend/templates/marketing/base.html:92
msgid "Akademik & rapor"
msgstr "Academics & report cards"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:12
msgid ""
"Kurikulum, jadwal, nilai, dan rapor siap cetak yang mengikuti format resmi."
msgstr ""
"Curriculum, schedules, grades, and print-ready report cards that follow the "
"official format."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:13 frontend/templates/marketing/base.html:93
msgid "Kehadiran & gerbang"
msgstr "Attendance & gate"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:13
msgid ""
"Absensi per sesi, pemindaian gerbang, dan notifikasi kedatangan ke orang tua"
" dalam hitungan detik."
msgstr ""
"Per-session attendance, gate scanning, and arrival notifications to parents "
"within seconds."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:14 frontend/templates/marketing/base.html:94
msgid "Keuangan & tagihan"
msgstr "Finance & billing"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:14
msgid ""
"Tagihan SPP otomatis, VA dan QRIS, alokasi pembayaran, serta buku besar yang"
" selalu seimbang."
msgstr ""
"Automatic tuition billing, VA and QRIS, payment allocation, and a ledger "
"that always balances."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:15
msgid "Kantin & dompet"
msgstr "Canteen & wallet"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:15
msgid ""
"Dompet siswa non-tunai, batas belanja harian, dan POS kantin yang tetap "
"jalan saat jaringan mati."
msgstr ""
"Cashless student wallets, daily spending limits, and a canteen POS that "
"keeps running when the network is down."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:16
msgid "Suite guru"
msgstr "Teacher suite"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:16
msgid ""
"Agenda mengajar, antrean penilaian, dan catatan kelas di web maupun ponsel."
msgstr "Teaching agenda, a grading queue, and class notes on web and mobile."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:17 apps/marketing/views.py:239
msgid "Aplikasi orang tua"
msgstr "Parent app"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:17
msgid ""
"Kehadiran, tagihan, saldo kantin, dan rapor anak — dalam satu aplikasi "
"ringan."
msgstr ""
"Attendance, bills, canteen balance, and report cards — in one lightweight "
"app."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:21
msgid "Dibuat untuk ponsel 3G"
msgstr "Built for 3G phones"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:21
msgid ""
"Setiap layar menyatakan kondisi memuat, data lama, dan offline secara "
"eksplisit. Aplikasi guru dan POS bekerja penuh tanpa jaringan."
msgstr ""
"Every screen states loading, stale-data, and offline states explicitly. The "
"teacher app and POS work fully offline."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:22
msgid "Dibangun untuk Indonesia"
msgstr "Built for Indonesia"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:22
msgid ""
"Dari format rapor resmi hingga VA dan QRIS, dari NISN hingga Dapodik — "
"dibangun dari nol untuk kebutuhan sekolah Indonesia, bukan ditempel "
"belakangan."
msgstr ""
"From official report card formats to VA and QRIS, from NISN to Dapodik — "
"built from the ground up for Indonesian schools, not bolted on after the "
"fact."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:23
msgid "Siap diaudit"
msgstr "Audit-ready"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:23
msgid ""
"Setiap tindakan yang mengubah data menulis jejak audit dengan aktor, waktu, "
"dan alasan. Tidak ada pengecualian untuk proses internal."
msgstr ""
"Every action that changes data writes an audit trail with actor, time, and "
"reason. No exceptions for internal processes."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:27
msgid "Ketua yayasan"
msgstr "Foundation chair"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:27
msgid ""
"Bandingkan sekolah, pantau kolektibilitas, dan setujui keringanan dalam satu"
" antrean."
msgstr ""
"Compare schools, monitor collectibility, and approve fee waivers in a single"
" queue."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:28
msgid "Admin sekolah"
msgstr "School admin"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:28
msgid ""
"Pendaftaran, mutasi, jadwal, dan pelaporan resmi tanpa spreadsheet paralel."
msgstr ""
"Enrollment, transfers, scheduling, and official reporting without parallel "
"spreadsheets."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:29
msgid "Guru"
msgstr "Teacher"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:29
msgid ""
"Absen satu sentuh, nilai tanpa menunggu jaringan, dan rapor yang terisi "
"sendiri."
msgstr ""
"One-tap attendance, grading without waiting on the network, and report cards"
" that fill themselves in."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:30
msgid "Orang tua"
msgstr "Parent"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:30
msgid ""
"Tahu anak sudah sampai, tahu berapa yang harus dibayar, bayar dari ponsel."
msgstr "Know your child has arrived, know what's owed, pay from your phone."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:34
msgid "Isolasi tenant"
msgstr "Tenant isolation"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:34
msgid ""
"Setiap tabel dikunci per yayasan di lapisan basis data, bukan hanya di "
"aplikasi."
msgstr ""
"Every table is locked per foundation at the database layer, not only in the "
"application."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:35
msgid "Retensi terjadwal"
msgstr "Scheduled retention"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:35
msgid ""
"Foto gerbang dan dokumen kedaluwarsa dihapus otomatis sesuai periode "
"statutori."
msgstr ""
"Gate photos and expired documents are deleted automatically per statutory "
"retention periods."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:36
msgid "Tanpa PII di log"
msgstr "No PII in logs"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:36
msgid "Nama, NISN, dan NIK tidak pernah masuk log, analitik, atau isi SMS."
msgstr "Names, NISN, and NIK never enter logs, analytics, or SMS content."

#: apps/marketing/views.py:37
msgid "Ekspor resmi"
msgstr "Official exports"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:37
msgid ""
"Jalur ekspor Dapodik dan EMIS mengikuti skema versi terbaru sebagai data, "
"bukan kode."
msgstr ""
"Dapodik and EMIS export paths follow the latest schema version as data, not "
"code."

