"<strong>Open Multi-Tenant Mode:</strong> Microsoft SSO currently accepts "
"staff accounts from any Microsoft organization as long as the user's email "
"is already registered in EduCore. To improve security and prevent linking "
"from external accounts, pin your foundation's official Directory ID below."

