msgstr "Financial records (invoices, payments, ledger)"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:29
msgid "10 tahun, sesuai kewajiban statutori"
msgstr "10 years, per statutory obligation"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:30
msgid "Catatan akademik & rapor"
msgstr "Academic records & report cards"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:30
msgid "Sesuai kebijakan sekolah — permanen secara default"
msgstr "Per school policy — permanent by default"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:31
msgid "Template biometrik (wajah/sidik jari)"
msgstr "Biometric templates (face/fingerprint)"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:31
msgid ""
"Dihapus saat siswa keluar atau saat persetujuan ditarik, maksimal 24 jam"
msgstr ""
"Deleted when a student leaves or consent is withdrawn, within 24 hours"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:32
msgid "Foto gerbang / kehadiran"
msgstr "Gate / attendance photos"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:32
msgid "90 hari secara default"
msgstr "90 days by default"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:33
msgid "Data kepegawaian staf"
msgstr "Staff employment records"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:33
msgid ""
"Sepanjang masa kerja, ditambah periode statutori ketenagakerjaan setelah "
"keluar"
msgstr ""
"For the duration of employment, plus the statutory employment retention "
"period after leaving"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:37
msgid ""
"Kebijakan retensi dijalankan oleh proses terjadwal otomatis, bukan proses "
"manual. Setiap eksekusi menghasilkan laporan dry-run yang mencantumkan "
"secara spesifik data mana yang akan dihapus sebelum penghapusan aktual "
"dilakukan, sehingga admin yayasan dapat meninjau sebelum data hilang secara "
"permanen."
msgstr ""
"Retention policy is enforced by an automated scheduled job, not a manual "
"process. Every run produces a dry-run report listing exactly which data "
"would be deleted before any actual deletion happens, so the foundation's "
"admin can review before data is permanently lost."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:40
msgid ""
"Orang tua/wali dapat menarik persetujuan penggunaan biometrik kapan saja "
"melalui aplikasi orang tua. Penarikan berlaku dalam 24 jam: template "
"biometrik dihapus dan siswa kembali menggunakan verifikasi kartu."
msgstr ""
"Parents/guardians can withdraw consent for biometric use at any time through"
" the parent app. Withdrawal takes effect within 24 hours: the biometric "
"template is deleted and the student reverts to card verification."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:43
msgid ""
"Permintaan penghapusan data pribadi sebelum periode retensi berakhir "
"diproses sepanjang tidak bertentangan dengan kewajiban statutori (misalnya "
"catatan keuangan yang wajib disimpan 10 tahun). Admin sekolah dapat "
"mengajukan permintaan ini dan menerima hasilnya dalam satu sesi "
"administrasi."
msgstr ""
"Requests to delete personal data before the retention period ends are "
"processed as long as they don't conflict with a statutory obligation (for "
"example, financial records that must be kept for 10 years). A school admin "
"can submit this request and get the result within a single admin session."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/data_retention.html:46
msgid ""
"Pertanyaan mengenai jadwal retensi atau permintaan penghapusan data dapat "
"dikirim ke"
msgstr ""
"Questions about the retention schedule or data deletion requests can be sent"
" to"

