#: frontend/templates/marketing/home.html:69
msgid "Modul"
msgstr "Modules"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/home.html:70
msgid "Semua yang dijalankan sekolah setiap hari."
msgstr "Everything a school runs every day."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/home.html:71
msgid ""
"Satu basis data, satu identitas, satu jejak audit. Modul dinyalakan per "
"sekolah sesuai kebutuhan yayasan."
msgstr ""
"One database, one identity, one audit trail. Modules are switched on per "
"school as the foundation needs."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/home.html:100
msgid "Untuk setiap peran di yayasan"
msgstr "For every role in the foundation"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/home.html:117
msgid "Data siswa diperlakukan seperti data yang diatur undang-undang."
msgstr "Student data is treated like data regulated by law."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/home.html:118
msgid ""
"EduCore dirancang mengikuti UU PDP: minimal data, retensi terbatas, dan "
"pemisahan tenant ditegakkan di lapisan basis data."
msgstr ""
"EduCore is designed to follow Indonesia's PDP Law: minimal data, limited "
"retention, and tenant separation enforced at the database layer."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/home.html:134
msgid "Lihat EduCore dengan data sekolah Anda."
msgstr "See EduCore with your school's own data."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/home.html:135
msgid ""
"Demo 45 menit bersama tim penerapan, memakai satu sekolah contoh dari "
"yayasan Anda."
msgstr ""
"A 45-minute demo with the implementation team, using one sample school from "
"your foundation."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:4
msgid "Partner & Vendor API — EduCore"
msgstr "Partner & Vendor API — EduCore"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:8
msgid "Integrasi mitra & vendor"
msgstr "Partner & vendor integration"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:9
msgid "API mitra untuk data sekolah."
msgstr "A partner API for school data."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:10
msgid ""
"Baca roster, data pribadi dan jabatan staf, tagihan, serta kehadiran dari "
"EduCore lewat REST yang berversi dan bertanda tangan."
msgstr ""
"Read roster, staff personal and position records, invoices and attendance "
"from EduCore over a versioned, signed REST surface."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:12
msgid "Kunci sandbox Partner API"
msgstr "Partner API sandbox key"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:12
msgid "Buat akun sandbox"
msgstr "Create a sandbox account"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:13
msgid "Baca dokumentasi"
msgstr "Read the documentation"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:19
msgid "Permukaan integrasi"
msgstr "Integration surface"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:20
msgid "Domain yang terbuka untuk mitra"
msgstr "Domains open to partners"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:21
msgid ""
"Setiap kunci API diberi cakupan per domain dan per sekolah. Cakupan yang "
"tidak diminta tidak pernah terbaca."
msgstr ""
"Every API key is scoped per domain and per school. A scope you did not "
"request is never readable."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:23
msgid "Batas data"
msgstr "Data boundary"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:24
msgid ""
"EduCore tidak menyimpan data penggajian atau kompensasi. Permukaan mitra "
"hanya memaparkan data pribadi, jabatan, dan kepegawaian — gaji, komponen "
"upah, potongan, dan slip tetap berada di sistem penggajian Anda sebagai "
"sumber kebenaran."
msgstr ""
"EduCore does not store payroll or compensation data. The partner surface "
"exposes personal, position and employment records only — salaries, pay "
"components, deductions and payslips stay in your payroll system as the "
"system of record."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:54
msgid ""
"Kunci berawalan <code>ak_test_</code> selalu menabrak data sintetis dan "
"tidak pernah mengirim notifikasi ke orang tua. Gunakan itu untuk seluruh "
"pengembangan."
msgstr ""
"Keys prefixed <code>ak_test_</code> always hit synthetic data and never send"
" notifications to parents. Use it for all development."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:59
msgid "Referensi"
msgstr "Reference"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:62
#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:77
msgid "Autentikasi"
msgstr "Authentication"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:63
#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:90
msgid "Versi & deprekasi"
msgstr "Versioning & deprecation"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:64
#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:93
msgid "Konvensi"
msgstr "Conventions"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:66
#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:123
msgid "Webhook & polling"
msgstr "Webhooks & polling"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:68
#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:147
msgid "Batas laju"
msgstr "Rate limits"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:78
msgid ""
"Setiap permintaan membawa key-id di header dan tanda tangan HMAC-SHA256 atas"
" <code>timestamp + method + path + body</code>. Secret tidak pernah dikirim."
" Permintaan dengan timestamp lebih dari 300 detik ditolak."
msgstr ""
"Every request carries a key-id header and an HMAC-SHA256 signature over "
"<code>timestamp + method + path + body</code>. The secret is never sent. "
"Requests with a timestamp older than 300 seconds are rejected."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:84
#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:95
msgid "Aturan"
msgstr "Rule"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:85
msgid "Cakupan"
msgstr "Scope"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:85
msgid ""
"Ditetapkan yayasan, per domain dan per sekolah. Tidak bisa diperluas oleh "
"mitra."
msgstr ""
"Set by the foundation, per domain and per school. Cannot be widened by the "
"partner."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:86
msgid "Rotasi"
msgstr "Rotation"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:86
msgid ""
"Dua kunci aktif maksimal 30 hari. Kunci lama jadi read-only saat hari ke-23."
msgstr ""
"At most two active keys for 30 days. The old key becomes read-only on day "
"23."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:87
msgid "Opsional per kunci, wajib untuk cakupan <code>roster.pii</code>."
msgstr "Optional per key, required for the <code>roster.pii</code> scope."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:91
msgid ""
"Versi ada di path, bukan header. Perubahan yang memutus kontrak selalu "
"menjadi <code>/api/v2/</code> baru; penambahan field opsional bukan "
"perubahan yang memutus. Versi lama hidup 12 bulan setelah pengganti keluar, "
"dan mengirim header <code>Sunset</code> sejak hari pertama."
msgstr ""
"The version lives in the path, not a header. Breaking changes always become "
"a new <code>/api/v2/</code>; adding an optional field is not a breaking "
"change. An old version lives for 12 months after its replacement ships, and "
"sends a <code>Sunset</code> header from day one."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:95
msgid "Bentuk"
msgstr "Shape"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:96
msgid "Paginasi"
msgstr "Pagination"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:97
msgid "Uang"
msgstr "Money"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:99
msgid "Idempotensi"
msgstr "Idempotency"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:99
msgid "<code>Idempotency-Key</code> — disimpan 7 hari"
msgstr "<code>Idempotency-Key</code> — kept for 7 days"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:101
msgid ""
"Format uang adalah string dengan mata uang di level objek yang sama. Jangan "
"pernah menjumlahkan lintas mata uang: endpoint agregat mengembalikan array "
"total per mata uang, bukan satu angka."
msgstr ""
"Money is a string with the currency at the same object level. Never sum "
"across currencies: aggregate endpoints return an array of totals per "
"currency, not a single number."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:104
msgid ""
"Semua error adalah RFC 9457 <code>application/problem+json</code>. Cabangkan"
" logika pada <code>code</code> — string SCREAMING_SNAKE yang stabil — bukan "
"pada prosa <code>detail</code>."
msgstr ""
"All errors are RFC 9457 <code>application/problem+json</code>. Branch your "
"logic on <code>code</code> — a stable SCREAMING_SNAKE string — not on the "
"<code>detail</code> prose."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:124
msgid ""
"Webhook adalah jalur utama. Daftarkan satu endpoint HTTPS per lingkungan, "
"terima POST bertanda tangan, dan balas 2xx dalam 5 detik. Kegagalan dicoba "
"ulang lima kali hingga 6 jam; setelahnya kejadian tetap tersedia lewat "
"polling."
msgstr ""
"Webhooks are the primary path. Register one HTTPS endpoint per environment, "
"accept a signed POST, and answer 2xx within 5 seconds. Failures retry five "
"times up to 6 hours; after that the event remains available by polling."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:126
msgid "Kejadian"
msgstr "Event"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:126
msgid "Dipicu saat"
msgstr "Triggered when"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:127
msgid "Data pribadi, jabatan, atau status kepegawaian staf berubah"
msgstr "A staff member's personal, position or employment record changed"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:128
msgid "Siswa aktif baru di sekolah dalam cakupan kunci"
msgstr "A new active student at a school in the key's scope"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:129
msgid "Pembayaran VA atau QRIS ter-settle dan teralokasi"
msgstr "A virtual-account or QRIS payment settled and was allocated"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:130
msgid "Kunci dirotasi — 30 hari sebelum yang lama mati"
msgstr "A key is rotated — 30 days before the old one dies"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:135
msgid "Metode & jalur"
msgstr "Method & path"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:135
msgid "Keterangan"
msgstr "Description"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:136
msgid "Yayasan yang memberi Anda akses"
msgstr "Foundations that granted you access"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:137
msgid "Sekolah dalam cakupan kunci"
msgstr "Schools within the key's scope"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:138
msgid "Staf aktif beserta jabatan, kursor terpaginasi"
msgstr "Active staff with position, cursor-paginated"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:139
msgid "Satu staf — data pribadi, jabatan, kepegawaian"
msgstr "One staff member — personal, position, employment"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:140
msgid "Siswa aktif per sekolah atau kelas"
msgstr "Active students by school or class"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:141
msgid "Tagihan dan sisa terutang"
msgstr "Invoices and outstanding balance"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:142
msgid "Rekap kehadiran harian per kelas"
msgstr "Daily attendance summary per class"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:143
msgid "Aliran kejadian — alternatif webhook"
msgstr "Event stream — a webhook alternative"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:144
msgid "Daftarkan endpoint penerima webhook"
msgstr "Register a webhook receiver"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:149
msgid "Batas"
msgstr "Limit"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:149
msgid "Nilai"
msgstr "Value"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:150
msgid "Permintaan per kunci"
msgstr "Requests per key"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:150
msgid "600 / menit"
msgstr "600 / minute"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:151
msgid "Baris maksimal per halaman kursor"
msgstr "Max rows per cursor page"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:152
msgid "Interval polling tercepat yang diizinkan"
msgstr "Fastest allowed polling interval"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:152
msgid "30 detik"
msgstr "30 seconds"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:154
msgid ""
"Melewati batas menghasilkan <code>429 RATE_LIMITED</code> dengan header "
"<code>Retry-After</code>. Ekspor besar memakai endpoint job asinkron, bukan "
"paginasi beruntun."
msgstr ""
"Exceeding the limit produces a <code>429 RATE_LIMITED</code> with a "
"<code>Retry-After</code> header. Large exports use an async job endpoint, "
"not sequential pagination."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:4
msgid "Kebijakan Privasi — EduCore"
msgstr "Privacy Policy — EduCore"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:9
msgid "Kebijakan Privasi"
msgstr "Privacy Policy"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:10
msgid ""
"Berlaku untuk data yang diproses EduCore atas nama yayasan pendidikan yang "
"menggunakan platform ini, sesuai UU No. 27 Tahun 2022 tentang Pelindungan "
"Data Pribadi (UU PDP)."
msgstr ""
"Applies to data EduCore processes on behalf of the education foundations "
"using this platform, per Law No. 27 of 2022 on Personal Data Protection (UU "
"PDP)."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:17
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:29
msgid "Peran pengendali & pemroses"
msgstr "Controller & processor roles"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:18
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:32
msgid "Data yang dikumpulkan"
msgstr "Data collected"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:19
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:35
msgid "Dasar & tujuan pemrosesan"
msgstr "Legal basis & purpose of processing"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:20
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:38
msgid "Keamanan & lokasi data"
msgstr "Security & data location"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:21
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:41
msgid "Hak subjek data"
msgstr "Data subject rights"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:22
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:44
msgid "Data anak"
msgstr "Children's data"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:23
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:47
msgid "Insiden kebocoran data"
msgstr "Data breach incidents"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:30
msgid ""
"Yayasan/sekolah adalah pengendali data (data controller) atas data siswa, "
"orang tua, dan staf yang dimasukkan ke EduCore. EduCore bertindak sebagai "
"pemroses data (data processor) yang memproses data tersebut hanya sesuai "
"instruksi tertulis yayasan, sebagaimana diatur dalam Perjanjian Pemrosesan "
"Data (DPA)."
msgstr ""
"The foundation/school is the data controller for student, parent, and staff "
"data entered into EduCore. EduCore acts as the data processor, processing "
"that data only per the foundation's written instructions, as set out in the "
"Data Processing Agreement (DPA)."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:33
msgid ""
"Bergantung pada modul yang diaktifkan yayasan, EduCore dapat memproses: "
"identitas siswa dan orang tua/wali (nama, NISN, NIK, tanggal lahir, alamat),"
" data kehadiran dan foto gerbang, template biometrik (opsional, dengan "
"persetujuan terpisah), data akademik dan rapor, data keuangan dan tagihan, "
"data kepegawaian dan jabatan staf, serta log komunikasi ke orang tua."
msgstr ""
"Depending on the modules a foundation enables, EduCore may process: student "
"and parent/guardian identity (name, NISN, NIK, date of birth, address), "
"attendance data and gate photos, biometric templates (optional, with "
"separate consent), academic and report card data, financial and billing "
"data, staff employment and role data, and logs of communication to parents."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:36
msgid ""
"Dasar hukum pemrosesan dicatat per tujuan (pelaksanaan layanan pendidikan, "
"kewajiban pelaporan ke pemerintah, atau persetujuan eksplisit untuk "
"biometrik, media, dan komunikasi pemasaran). Persetujuan diminta per tujuan "
"secara terpisah — tidak pernah digabung dalam satu persetujuan umum — dan "
"dicatat dengan versi serta waktu."
msgstr ""
"The legal basis for processing is recorded per purpose (delivering the "
"education service, government reporting obligations, or explicit consent for"
" biometrics, media, and marketing communication). Consent is requested per "
"purpose, separately — never bundled into one general consent — and recorded "
"with a version and timestamp."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:39
msgid ""
"Seluruh data produksi — basis data, penyimpanan objek, cadangan, dan log — "
"berada di pusat data Indonesia, tanpa replikasi lintas negara. Data "
"terenkripsi TLS 1.3 saat transit dan AES-256 saat tersimpan, dengan kunci "
"enkripsi terpisah untuk PII umum, template biometrik, dan data "
"kesehatan/konseling. Akses staf EduCore ke lingkungan produksi dibatasi "
"waktu, disetujui, dan tercatat — tidak ada kredensial produksi yang berlaku "
"permanen."
msgstr ""
"All production data — database, object storage, backups, and logs — resides "
"in Indonesian data centres, with no cross-border replication. Data is "
"encrypted with TLS 1.3 in transit and AES-256 at rest, with separate "
"encryption keys for general PII, biometric templates, and health/counselling"
" data. EduCore staff access to production is time-boxed, approved, and "
"logged — no standing production credentials exist."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:42
msgid ""
"Orang tua/wali dan staf dapat mengajukan permintaan akses, koreksi, "
"penghapusan, pembatasan pemrosesan, atau portabilitas data melalui admin "
"sekolah. Permintaan yang sah dilayani dalam 30 hari, kecuali data yang wajib"
" dipertahankan sesuai kewajiban retensi statutori (lihat"
msgstr ""
"Parents/guardians and staff can submit requests for access, correction, "
"deletion, restriction of processing, or data portability through the school "
"admin. Valid requests are served within 30 days, except for data that must "
"be retained under a statutory retention obligation (see"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:45
msgid ""
"Pengaturan berbagi data siswa secara default menggunakan opsi paling ketat. "
"Perluasan akses (misalnya berbagi data ke pihak ketiga baru) hanya dapat "
"dilakukan lewat tindakan eksplisit admin sekolah dan selalu tercatat dalam "
"jejak audit."
msgstr ""
"Student data sharing settings default to the most restrictive option. "
"Widening access (for example, sharing data with a new third party) can only "
"be done through an explicit action by the school admin, and is always "
"recorded in the audit trail."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:48
msgid ""
"Dugaan kebocoran data pribadi ditangani melalui prosedur insiden internal "
"dengan jam notifikasi 3×24 jam kepada yayasan terdampak, disertai bukti "
"kejadian dan daftar subjek data yang terpengaruh."
msgstr ""
"Suspected personal data breaches are handled through an internal incident "
"procedure with a 3×24-hour notification clock to the affected foundation, "
"including evidence of the incident and a list of affected data subjects."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:51
msgid ""
"Pertanyaan mengenai kebijakan ini atau permintaan terkait data pribadi dapat"
" dikirim ke"
msgstr ""
"Questions about this policy or requests related to personal data can be sent"
" to"

#: frontend/templates/pages/foundation_microsoft_tenant_page.html:10
msgid "Pengaturan SSO Microsoft Entra — EduCore"
msgstr "Microsoft Entra SSO Settings — EduCore"

#: frontend/templates/pages/foundation_microsoft_tenant_page.html:15
#| msgid "Ketua yayasan"
